688→    }
689→
690→  /* Clear RXPKTRDY for non-EP0 endpoints.
691→   * For EP0, the caller (ep0setup) will clear RXPKTRDY with appropriate
692→   * flags (SVDRXPKTRDY alone or SVDRXPKTRDY | DATAEND) depending on
693→   * whether there is a data phase.
